{"id":"8ad5058535b9125d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-omega-consistency.md","title":"$\\omega$-一致性","display":"df-omega-consistency — $\\omega$-一致性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-omega-consistency","aliases":["91-df-omega-consistency","91-df-omega-con"],"display":"df-omega-consistency — $\\omega$-一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-omega-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-omega-consistency</span><span>91-df-omega-con</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-consistency — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-omega-consistency-—-$\\omega$-一致性-$\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}$\">df-omega-consistency — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}\">\\(\\mathcal{T}\\)</span> (理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal T}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal T}}\\)</span> (至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为自由变元的公式集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (标准自然数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal T}}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n)\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal T}}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n)\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x \\varphi(x)\">\\(\\exists x \\varphi(x)\\)</span> : 存在量词断言</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(n)\">\\(\\varphi(n)\\)</span> : 数字<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>代入</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性的含义：\n若理论证明&quot;存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;，则不能同时证明每个标准数字都不满足。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性 vs 标准一致性：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>标准一致性</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>定义</td>\n<td>不证明矛盾</td>\n<td>量词与实例一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强度</td>\n<td>较弱</td>\n<td>较强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{-Con} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{-Con} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Con}\\)</span></td>\n<td>标准一致性不蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的例子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T} \\vdash \\exists x \\varphi(x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{T} \\vdash \\exists x \\varphi(x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T} \\vdash \\neg \\varphi(0), \\neg \\varphi(1), \\neg \\varphi(2), ...\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{T} \\vdash \\neg \\varphi(0), \\neg \\varphi(1), \\neg \\varphi(2), ...\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这可以是标准一致的（如果<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>只对非标准元素成立）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性在真理理论中的重要性：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>标准版本是典型的语法一致但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>其一致性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性须分别分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>FS 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致并不等于语法不一致；因此不能把\n“FS 一致”与“PA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性”写成无条件等价。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性的哲学意义：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>意义</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>标准模型限制</td>\n<td>排除非标准解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实性保证</td>\n<td>保证断言有真实实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强可靠性</td>\n<td>比标准一致性更强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解FS理论的一致性条件</li>\n<li>区分标准一致性与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性</li>\n<li>分析真理理论的可靠性要求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-omega-consistency-—-$\\omega$-一致性-$\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}$","text":"df-omega-consistency — $\\omega$-一致性 $\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal T}}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal T}}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n)\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{-Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x \\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{-Con} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T} \\vdash \\exists x \\varphi(x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T} \\vdash \\neg \\varphi(0), \\neg \\varphi(1), \\neg \\varphi(2), ...","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2494,"backlinks":[{"id":"6490c20309820655","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cda20fabbaa06580","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8556c1ac7447fbfa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-omega-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditio